OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FElizabeth Alker introduces
OL,7,     Fhighlights from the BBC Proms,
OL,8,     Fincluding Stravinsky's ballet
OL,9,     FPetrushka and Copland's Billy the
OL,10,     FKid. Plus Vivaldi from the Venice
OL,11,     FBaroque Orchestra.
OL,12,G1600 Composer of the Week: Mendelssohn
OL,13,     F4/5. Kate Molleson follows
OL,14,     FMendelssohn's grand tour through
OL,15,     FVenice, Rome and Naples.
OL,16,G1700 In Tune
OL,17,     FPetroc Trelawny welcomes composer
OL,18,     FErland Cooper to the In Tune
OL,19,     Fstudio to discuss the upcoming
OL,20,     FUltimate Calm Late Night Prom, and
OL,21,     Fwe talk to pianist Vikingur
OL,22,     FOlafsson.
